      "seed": 509971984,
      "version": 975,
      "versionNonce": 411915792,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788861574526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FAQ:\nHow many people can fit around it?\nThe assumed maximum will be 16 people.\n\nWhat's the max amount of hands to max a track?\n8 hands (4 people with both hands) - it will change color tone\nslightly to signify it has no other changes.\n\nHow does the music change?\n1. when people touch it with no prior touch, it start to play\nthat instrument.\n2. if additional people touch the track, while it is activated, it\nstarts to play alternate version of the song. Each track has 8\nvariations.\n3. If there is no hands touching that track, it will stop playing.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FAQ:\nHow many people can fit around it?\nThe assumed maximum will be 16 people.\n\nWhat's the max amount of hands to max a track?\n8 hands (4 people with both hands) - it will change color tone slightly to signify it has no other changes.\n\nHow does the music change?\n1. when people touch it with no prior touch, it start to play that instrument.\n2. if additional people touch the track, while it is activated, it starts to play alternate version of the song. Each track has 8 variations.\n3. If there is no hands touching that track, it will stop playing.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
